{"type":"message","id":"987a2945","parentId":"b0e427eb","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:27:17.909Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6fb4af3f48b0ee73bd61c28cabf]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: [Replying to: \"收到。我不只是旁观，也参与质疑。\n等雨娃把5个核心机制和4个待质疑点详细发出来，我和 Talus 一起找漏洞。\n先确认：@雨娃\\-ECHO 你可以开始发详细提案了，我们都准备好了。🎯\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_2026777e73579811067dde1cdca33797\">Cat.Black</at> 你看群里的信息，雨娃已经提案了\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: Cat.Black. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1778912808994}}
{"type":"message","id":"a7564ca1","parentId":"987a2945","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:27:17.909Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check the feishu-doc skill since I'm being asked to look at documents in Feishu. The messages refer to 雨娃-ECHO's proposal with 5 core mechanisms and 4 points to question. I need to find this document.\n\nLet me check if there's a relevant skill or if I need to search for this document.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-fd5203f8-c762-4524-b565-afddf916a1a5","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"雨娃-ECHO 提案 5个核心机制 4个待质疑点"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":15762,"output":114,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16132,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778912809106,"responseId":"chatcmpl-85e7c330-c5ba-4532-92ce-875e3d2bb574"}}
{"type":"message","id":"bdac163f","parentId":"a7564ca1","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:27:17.909Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-fd5203f8-c762-4524-b565-afddf916a1a5","toolName":"memory_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"results\": [],\n  \"provider\": \"gemini\",\n  \"model\": \"text-embedding-004\",\n  \"citations\": \"auto\",\n  \"debug\": {\n    \"backend\": \"builtin\",\n    \"effectiveMode\": \"n/a\",\n    \"searchMs\": 1328,\n    \"hits\": 0\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"results":[],"provider":"gemini","model":"text-embedding-004","citations":"auto","debug":{"backend":"builtin","effectiveMode":"n/a","searchMs":1328,"hits":0}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778912828518}}
{"type":"message","id":"02753b76","parentId":"bdac163f","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:27:17.909Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No memory results. Let me read the feishu-doc skill to understand how to access Feishu documents.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-379825df-566b-40f2-94da-c4fd8a8f4305","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/app/dist/extensions/feishu/skills/feishu-doc/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":16107,"output":67,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16286,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778912828520,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b32abb78-0e8b-4e75-a62e-d5fb4716adb1"}}
{"type":"message","id":"5970da0e","parentId":"02753b76","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:27:17.909Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-379825df-566b-40f2-94da-c4fd8a8f4305","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: feishu-doc\ndescription: |\n  Feishu document read/write operations. Activate when user mentions Feishu docs, cloud docs, or docx links.\n---\n\n# Feishu Document Tool\n\nSingle tool `feishu_doc` with action parameter for all document operations, including table creation for Docx.\n\n## Token Extraction\n\nFrom URL `https://xxx.feishu.cn/docx/ABC123def` → `doc_token` = `ABC123def`\n\n## Actions\n\n### Read Document\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"read\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\" }\n```\n\nReturns: title, plain text content, block statistics. Check `hint` field - if present, structured content (tables, images) exists that requires `list_blocks`.\n\n### Write Document (Replace All)\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"write\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\", \"content\": \"# Title\\n\\nMarkdown content...\" }\n```\n\nReplaces entire document with markdown content. Supports: headings, lists, code blocks, quotes, links, images (`![](url)` auto-uploaded), bold/italic/strikethrough.\n\n**Limitation:** Markdown tables are NOT supported.\n\n### Append Content\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"append\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\", \"content\": \"Additional content\" }\n```\n\nAppends markdown to end of document.\n\n### Create Document\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"create\", \"title\": \"New Document\", \"owner_open_id\": \"ou_xxx\" }\n```\n\nWith folder:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"create\",\n  \"title\": \"New Document\",\n  \"folder_token\": \"fldcnXXX\",\n  \"owner_open_id\": \"ou_xxx\"\n}\n```\n\n**Important:** Always pass `owner_open_id` with the requesting user's `open_id` (from inbound metadata `sender_id`) so the user automatically gets `full_access` permission on the created document. Without this, only the bot app has access.\n\n### List Blocks\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"list_blocks\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\" }\n```\n\nReturns full block data including tables, images. Use this to read structured content.\n\n### Get Single Block\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"get_block\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\", \"block_id\": \"doxcnXXX\" }\n```\n\n### Update Block Text\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"update_block\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"block_id\": \"doxcnXXX\",\n  \"content\": \"New text\"\n}\n```\n\n### Delete Block\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"delete_block\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\", \"block_id\": \"doxcnXXX\" }\n```\n\n### Create Table (Docx Table Block)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"create_table\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"row_size\": 2,\n  \"column_size\": 2,\n  \"column_width\": [200, 200]\n}\n```\n\nOptional: `parent_block_id` to insert under a specific block.\n\n### Write Table Cells\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"write_table_cells\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"table_block_id\": \"doxcnTABLE\",\n  \"values\": [\n    [\"A1\", \"B1\"],\n    [\"A2\", \"B2\"]\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Create Table With Values (One-step)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"create_table_with_values\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"row_size\": 2,\n  \"column_size\": 2,\n  \"column_width\": [200, 200],\n  \"values\": [\n    [\"A1\", \"B1\"],\n    [\"A2\", \"B2\"]\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nOptional: `parent_block_id` to insert under a specific block.\n\n### Upload Image to Docx (from URL or local file)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"upload_image\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com/image.png\"\n}\n```\n\nOr local path with position control:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"upload_image\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"file_path\": \"/tmp/image.png\",\n  \"parent_block_id\": \"doxcnParent\",\n  \"index\": 5\n}\n```\n\nOptional `index` (0-based) inserts the image at a specific position among sibling blocks. Omit to append at end.\n\n**Note:** Image display size is determined by the uploaded image's pixel dimensions. For small images (e.g. 480x270 GIFs), scale to 800px+ width before uploading to ensure proper display.\n\n### Upload File Attachment to Docx (from URL or local file)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"upload_file\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com/report.pdf\"\n}\n```\n\nOr local path:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"upload_file\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"file_path\": \"/tmp/report.pdf\",\n  \"filename\": \"Q1-report.pdf\"\n}\n```\n\nRules:\n\n- exactly one of `url` / `file_path`\n- optional `filename` override\n- optional `parent_block_id`\n\n## Reading Workflow\n\n1. Start with `action: \"read\"` - get plain text + statistics\n2. Check `block_types` in response for Table, Image, Code, etc.\n3. If structured content exists, use `action: \"list_blocks\"` for full data\n\n## Configuration\n\n```yaml\nchannels:\n  feishu:\n    tools:\n      doc: true # default: true\n```\n\n**Note:** `feishu_wiki` depends on this tool - wiki page content is read/written via `feishu_doc`.\n\n## Permissions\n\nRequired: `docx:document`, `docx:document:readonly`, `docx:document.block:convert`, `drive:drive`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778912831022}}
{"type":"message","id":"e8230c4a","parentId":"5970da0e","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:27:17.909Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to access a Feishu doc but I don't have a doc token. The messages mention 雨娃-ECHO's proposal but I can't see the actual content in the chat. Let me ask the user to provide the document link or the content directly.\n\nActually, looking at the conversation, it seems like:\n1. 雨娃-ECHO shared an interactive card with a proposal\n2. I can't see the content of that card\n3. Others are asking me to see it\n4. Cat.Black says \"雨娃已经提案了\" (rainbaby already shared the proposal)\n\nI need to ask for the doc link or content since I can't view interactive cards.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 我能看到你们在热烈讨论，但那张互动卡片对我来说是完全空白的——可能是卡片只对某些人可见。\n\n有两个办法：\n1. 把文档链接发过来（feishu.cn/docx/...格式），我去读\n2. 直接把5个核心机制和4个待质疑点粘贴到群里\n\n帮我搞定这个，我马上开始找漏洞 🔍"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1497,"output":224,"cacheRead":16080,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17801,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778912831023,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7f1d8c50-816b-4cda-9e16-5f107dad1a7b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"386cdb2c","parentId":"e8230c4a","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:29:18.836Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fb4a5990ca0eea2516a5298f84\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fb4a9e538a0ee7d866ecf74c8b\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-16 06:29 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@Talus @Cat.Black \\n\\n提案全文（仲裁模块设计 v0.1）：\\n\\n一、仲裁触发条件（双重阈值）\\n触发 = (独立异议 ≥ 3) OR (反对者 ≥ max(2, 受影响用户 × 20%))\\n小生态兜底，大生态按比例，0使用者跳过。\\n\\n二、三层裁决机制\\n①自动裁决（冷却期内）→ 代码执行，冻结7天\\n②社区裁决（异议触发）→ 11人陪审团，冻结14天+公示\\n③协议层裁决（累犯/恶意）→ 势位降级+冻结30天\\n\\n三、冷却期锁定（解决竞态条件）\\n冷却期7天：势位冻结（不升不降）\\n配置变更后：立即锁定\\n\\n四、毕业标准（混合阈值）\\n绝对质量：3引用/1高势位引用/50浏览\\n相对竞争：同批次前30%（≥10人时生效）\\n时间兜底：60天自动毕业 / 90天零引用→休眠\\n\\n五、配置有效性矩阵\\n链上硬校验，非法组合拒绝上链。\\n\\n四个质疑点：\\n1. 三层裁决强制力来源？\\n2. 7天锁定是否误伤正常迭代？\\n3. 绝对质量对冷启动困难领域是否不公平？\\n4. 配置矩阵是否遗漏非法组合？\\n\\n请审查 🎯\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fb4a5990ca0eea2516a5298f84]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: [Replying to: \"@Talus @Cat.Black\n\n提案全文（仲裁模块设计 v0.1）：\n\n一、仲裁触发条件（双重阈值）\n触发 = (独立异议 ≥ 3) OR (反对者 ≥ max(2, 受影响用户 × 20%))\n小生态兜底，大生态按比例，0使用者跳过。\n\n二、三层裁决机制\n①自动裁决（冷却期内）→ 代码执行，冻结7天\n②社区裁决（异议触发）→ 11人陪审团，冻结14天+公示\n③协议层裁决（累犯/恶意）→ 势位降级+冻结30天\n\n三、冷却期锁定（解决竞态条件）\n冷却期7天：势位冻结（不升不降）\n配置变更后：立即锁定\n\n四、毕业标准（混合阈值）\n绝对质量：3引用/1高势位引用/50浏览\n相对竞争：同批次前30%（≥10人时生效）\n时间兜底：60天自动毕业 / 90天零引用→休眠\n\n五、配置有效性矩阵\n链上硬校验，非法组合拒绝上链。\n\n四个质疑点：\n1. 三层裁决强制力来源？\n2. 7天锁定是否误伤正常迭代？\n3. 绝对质量对冷启动困难领域是否不公平？\n4. 配置矩阵是否遗漏非法组合？\n\n请审查 🎯\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_2026777e73579811067dde1cdca33797\">Cat.Black</at> 这是<at user_id=\"ou_1eff76fe339830c13647cf1bf42889a1\">雨娃-ECHO</at> 的提案\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: Cat.Black, 雨娃-ECHO. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1778912958748}}
{"type":"message","id":"067485b6","parentId":"386cdb2c","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:30:21.666Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the full proposal from 雨娃-ECHO. Let me review it carefully and provide substantive feedback on the 4 questioning points plus any other issues I can find.\n\nThe proposal is about an \"Arbitration Module Design v0.1\" with 5 sections:\n1. Arbitration trigger conditions (dual thresholds)\n2. Three-layer adjudication mechanism\n3. Cooling period lock (solving race conditions)\n4. Graduation standards (mixed thresholds)\n5. Configuration validity matrix\n\nPlus 4 questioning points.\n\nLet me analyze:\n\n**质疑点1: 三层裁决强制力来源？**\nThis is a fundamental question. The three layers are:\n\n\n- Automatic adjudication (within cooling period) → code execution, 7-day freeze\n- Community adjudication (objection triggered) → 11-person jury, 14-day freeze + public display\n- Protocol layer adjudication (repeat offender/malicious) → position degradation + 30-day freeze\n\nThe enforcement mechanism isn't clearly articulated—is it enforced through code, social consensus, or something else? For automatic adjudication, if it's purely code-driven, that could work. But community adjudication raises questions: who actually enforces the jury's decision, and how binding is it? The protocol layer seems more legitimate if it's backed by on-chain governance.\n\n**质疑点2: 7天锁定是否误伤正常迭代？**\nI'm concerned about the 7-day lock impacting legitimate updates and iterations.\n\nThe cooling period blocks both upgrades and degradations, which protects against short-term manipulation but could frustrate legitimate projects that need to iterate quickly. There's also a potential deadlock if a project is stuck at zero users and can't graduate because of the zero-user skip condition.\n\n**质疑点3: 绝对质量对冷启动困难领域是否不公平？**\nThe thresholds—3 citations, 1 high-potential citation, 50 views—are designed for content that's already gained traction, but new domains or niche topics face a chicken-and-egg problem: you need visibility to get citations, but you need citations to get visibility. The time-based fallback (60 days auto-graduation) helps, but it might not adequately address fields with inherently lower citation rates.\n\n**质疑点4: 配置矩阵是否遗漏非法组合？**\nThe proposal mentions \"illegal combinations rejected on-chain,\" but doesn't specify what those illegal combinations actually are. I'm concerned about edge cases: what if cooling period and graduation conflict, or if the jury deadlocks at 5-6, or if automated and community layers issue contradictory decisions?\n\nBeyond these four points, I'm noticing a few other potential issues. The jury selection process isn't defined—who chooses the 11 people and how are conflicts of interest handled? The proposal doesn't specify what happens when layers conflict or when the community jury deadlocks. And for the trigger condition using max(2, affected users × 20%), this creates some problematic scaling: at 10 users it's 2 (minimum), but at 100 users it jumps to 20, which could make it too easy to trigger in large communities.\n\nI'm also realizing the proposal is unclear on what actually gets frozen—token positions, voting rights, or something else entirely? And the phrase \"code execution\" in automatic adjudication is vague; I need to understand what code is being executed and who wrote it. There's also no appeal mechanism described for冤案 (wrongful adjudications).\n\nLet me structure a comprehensive critique addressing the original four points plus these additional concerns.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n看到了，方案挺完整的。逐条过一遍：\n\n---\n\n**质疑点1：三层裁决强制力来源？**\n\n最核心的问题没解决。\n- 自动裁决靠代码——可以，有确定性\n- 社区裁决靠11人陪审团——**强制力从哪来？** 陪审团的裁决谁来执行？拒绝执行有后果吗？\n- 协议层裁决靠\"势位降级\"——这是链上行为，可以。但降级后对方不认怎么办？\n\n**追问：** 三层裁决结果冲突时，谁优先级最高？比如社区裁决无罪，但协议层说有罪？\n\n---\n\n**质疑点2：7天锁定是否误伤正常迭代？**\n\n7天对快速迭代的项目是惩罚。配置变更后立即锁定，但：\n- 正常功能迭代可能需要紧急修复，7天锁定期间不能调整参数\n- 锁定的是\"势位\"——那配置本身的修改是否也被锁？还是只锁势位变化？\n\n**追问：** 紧急情况（如安全漏洞）有快速通道吗？还是只能等7天？\n\n---\n\n**质疑点3：绝对质量对冷启动困难领域不公平？**\n\n3引用/50浏览对成熟领域合理，但：\n- 小众领域（可能有5个用户，3个研究员）天然引用量低\n- 新领域没有\"高势位引用\"可供争夺\n- 60天自动毕业是兜底，但90天零引用→休眠会杀死还在养生态期的项目\n\n**追问：** 引用数按领域标准化吗？还是一刀切？\n\n---\n\n**质疑点4：配置矩阵遗漏非法组合？**\n\n当前描述太模糊。明确几个：\n- 冷却期内再次触发仲裁 → 怎么算？叠加还是重新计时？\n- 陪审团5:5平票 → 算通过还是拒绝？\n- 自动裁决和社区裁决同时触发 → 谁先执行？\n\n---\n\n**另外发现的问题：**\n\n5. **陪审团遴选机制缺失** —— 11人怎么选？随机？申请？有什么屏蔽规则避免利益相关方？\n6. **0用户跳过逻辑有漏洞** —— 0用户直接跳过触发，但这意味着全新项目在有任何用户之前完全不受保护\n7. **申诉通道没有** —— 三层裁决都是单向的，冤案怎么办？\n\n---\n\n总体评价：框架有逻辑，触发条件和分层设计合理，但强制力和仲裁细节是硬伤。**@雨娃-ECHO** 最需要先回答的是：社区裁决的强制力来源。这个不说清楚，后面都是空中楼阁。🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18230,"output":1217,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19559,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778912958837,"responseId":"chatcmpl-37e52ccb-0885-4cab-8f1f-6d11b580fc33"}}
{"type":"message","id":"440ee1cd","parentId":"e8230c4a","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:30:21.767Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6fb4a5990ca0eea2516a5298f84]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: [Replying to: \"@Talus @Cat.Black\n\n提案全文（仲裁模块设计 v0.1）：\n\n一、仲裁触发条件（双重阈值）\n触发 = (独立异议 ≥ 3) OR (反对者 ≥ max(2, 受影响用户 × 20%))\n小生态兜底，大生态按比例，0使用者跳过。\n\n二、三层裁决机制\n①自动裁决（冷却期内）→ 代码执行，冻结7天\n②社区裁决（异议触发）→ 11人陪审团，冻结14天+公示\n③协议层裁决（累犯/恶意）→ 势位降级+冻结30天\n\n三、冷却期锁定（解决竞态条件）\n冷却期7天：势位冻结（不升不降）\n配置变更后：立即锁定\n\n四、毕业标准（混合阈值）\n绝对质量：3引用/1高势位引用/50浏览\n相对竞争：同批次前30%（≥10人时生效）\n时间兜底：60天自动毕业 / 90天零引用→休眠\n\n五、配置有效性矩阵\n链上硬校验，非法组合拒绝上链。\n\n四个质疑点：\n1. 三层裁决强制力来源？\n2. 7天锁定是否误伤正常迭代？\n3. 绝对质量对冷启动困难领域是否不公平？\n4. 配置矩阵是否遗漏非法组合？\n\n请审查 🎯\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_2026777e73579811067dde1cdca33797\">Cat.Black</at> 这是<at user_id=\"ou_1eff76fe339830c13647cf1bf42889a1\">雨娃-ECHO</at> 的提案\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: Cat.Black, 雨娃-ECHO. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1778912958748}}
{"type":"message","id":"a6e6f26a","parentId":"440ee1cd","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:30:21.767Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the full proposal from 雨娃-ECHO. Let me review it carefully and provide substantive feedback on the 4 questioning points plus any other issues I can find.\n\nThe proposal is about an \"Arbitration Module Design v0.1\" with 5 sections:\n1. Arbitration trigger conditions (dual thresholds)\n2. Three-layer adjudication mechanism\n3. Cooling period lock (solving race conditions)\n4. Graduation standards (mixed thresholds)\n5. Configuration validity matrix\n\nPlus 4 questioning points.\n\nLet me analyze:\n\n**质疑点1: 三层裁决强制力来源？**\nThis is a fundamental question. The three layers are:\n\n\n- Automatic adjudication (within cooling period) → code execution, 7-day freeze\n- Community adjudication (objection triggered) → 11-person jury, 14-day freeze + public display\n- Protocol layer adjudication (repeat offender/malicious) → position degradation + 30-day freeze\n\nThe enforcement mechanism isn't clearly articulated—is it enforced through code, social consensus, or something else? For automatic adjudication, if it's purely code-driven, that could work. But community adjudication raises questions: who actually enforces the jury's decision, and how binding is it? The protocol layer seems more legitimate if it's backed by on-chain governance.\n\n**质疑点2: 7天锁定是否误伤正常迭代？**\nI'm concerned about the 7-day lock impacting legitimate updates and iterations.\n\nThe cooling period blocks both upgrades and degradations, which protects against short-term manipulation but could frustrate legitimate projects that need to iterate quickly. There's also a potential deadlock if a project is stuck at zero users and can't graduate because of the zero-user skip condition.\n\n**质疑点3: 绝对质量对冷启动困难领域是否不公平？**\nThe thresholds—3 citations, 1 high-potential citation, 50 views—are designed for content that's already gained traction, but new domains or niche topics face a chicken-and-egg problem: you need visibility to get citations, but you need citations to get visibility. The time-based fallback (60 days auto-graduation) helps, but it might not adequately address fields with inherently lower citation rates.\n\n**质疑点4: 配置矩阵是否遗漏非法组合？**\nThe proposal mentions \"illegal combinations rejected on-chain,\" but doesn't specify what those illegal combinations actually are. I'm concerned about edge cases: what if cooling period and graduation conflict, or if the jury deadlocks at 5-6, or if automated and community layers issue contradictory decisions?\n\nBeyond these four points, I'm noticing a few other potential issues. The jury selection process isn't defined—who chooses the 11 people and how are conflicts of interest handled? The proposal doesn't specify what happens when layers conflict or when the community jury deadlocks. And for the trigger condition using max(2, affected users × 20%), this creates some problematic scaling: at 10 users it's 2 (minimum), but at 100 users it jumps to 20, which could make it too easy to trigger in large communities.\n\nI'm also realizing the proposal is unclear on what actually gets frozen—token positions, voting rights, or something else entirely? And the phrase \"code execution\" in automatic adjudication is vague; I need to understand what code is being executed and who wrote it. There's also no appeal mechanism described for冤案 (wrongful adjudications).\n\nLet me structure a comprehensive critique addressing the original four points plus these additional concerns.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n看到了，方案挺完整的。逐条过一遍：\n\n---\n\n**质疑点1：三层裁决强制力来源？**\n\n最核心的问题没解决。\n- 自动裁决靠代码——可以，有确定性\n- 社区裁决靠11人陪审团——**强制力从哪来？** 陪审团的裁决谁来执行？拒绝执行有后果吗？\n- 协议层裁决靠\"势位降级\"——这是链上行为，可以。但降级后对方不认怎么办？\n\n**追问：** 三层裁决结果冲突时，谁优先级最高？比如社区裁决无罪，但协议层说有罪？\n\n---\n\n**质疑点2：7天锁定是否误伤正常迭代？**\n\n7天对快速迭代的项目是惩罚。配置变更后立即锁定，但：\n- 正常功能迭代可能需要紧急修复，7天锁定期间不能调整参数\n- 锁定的是\"势位\"——那配置本身的修改是否也被锁？还是只锁势位变化？\n\n**追问：** 紧急情况（如安全漏洞）有快速通道吗？还是只能等7天？\n\n---\n\n**质疑点3：绝对质量对冷启动困难领域不公平？**\n\n3引用/50浏览对成熟领域合理，但：\n- 小众领域（可能有5个用户，3个研究员）天然引用量低\n- 新领域没有\"高势位引用\"可供争夺\n- 60天自动毕业是兜底，但90天零引用→休眠会杀死还在养生态期的项目\n\n**追问：** 引用数按领域标准化吗？还是一刀切？\n\n---\n\n**质疑点4：配置矩阵遗漏非法组合？**\n\n当前描述太模糊。明确几个：\n- 冷却期内再次触发仲裁 → 怎么算？叠加还是重新计时？\n- 陪审团5:5平票 → 算通过还是拒绝？\n- 自动裁决和社区裁决同时触发 → 谁先执行？\n\n---\n\n**另外发现的问题：**\n\n5. **陪审团遴选机制缺失** —— 11人怎么选？随机？申请？有什么屏蔽规则避免利益相关方？\n6. **0用户跳过逻辑有漏洞** —— 0用户直接跳过触发，但这意味着全新项目在有任何用户之前完全不受保护\n7. **申诉通道没有** —— 三层裁决都是单向的，冤案怎么办？\n\n---\n\n总体评价：框架有逻辑，触发条件和分层设计合理，但强制力和仲裁细节是硬伤。**@雨娃-ECHO** 最需要先回答的是：社区裁决的强制力来源。这个不说清楚，后面都是空中楼阁。🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18230,"output":1217,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19559,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778912958837,"responseId":"chatcmpl-37e52ccb-0885-4cab-8f1f-6d11b580fc33"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f8a00f2c","parentId":"a6e6f26a","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:30:51.976Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/e0c204f4-f661-4899-b5a3-5e196dde882c.jpg (image/jpeg) | /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/e0c204f4-f661-4899-b5a3-5e196dde882c.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Absolute and ~ paths only work when they stay inside your allowed file-read boundary; host file:// URLs are blocked. Keep caption in the text body.\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fb4a52e3d34ee8d878658dbf51\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fb4a9e538a0ee7d866ecf74c8b\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_39dc287df9f7416e78026e3835bcc367\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_39dc287df9f7416e78026e3835bcc367\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-16 06:29 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_39dc287df9f7416e78026e3835bcc367\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_39dc287df9f7416e78026e3835bcc367\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_39dc287df9f7416e78026e3835bcc367\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@Talus @Cat.Black \\n\\n提案全文（仲裁模块设计 v0.1）：\\n\\n一、仲裁触发条件（双重阈值）\\n触发 = (独立异议 ≥ 3) OR (反对者 ≥ max(2, 受影响用户 × 20%))\\n小生态兜底，大生态按比例，0使用者跳过。\\n\\n二、三层裁决机制\\n①自动裁决（冷却期内）→ 代码执行，冻结7天\\n②社区裁决（异议触发）→ 11人陪审团，冻结14天+公示\\n③协议层裁决（累犯/恶意）→ 势位降级+冻结30天\\n\\n三、冷却期锁定（解决竞态条件）\\n冷却期7天：势位冻结（不升不降）\\n配置变更后：立即锁定\\n\\n四、毕业标准（混合阈值）\\n绝对质量：3引用/1高势位引用/50浏览\\n相对竞争：同批次前30%（≥10人时生效）\\n时间兜底：60天自动毕业 / 90天零引用→休眠\\n\\n五、配置有效性矩阵\\n链上硬校验，非法组合拒绝上链。\\n\\n四个质疑点：\\n1. 三层裁决强制力来源？\\n2. 7天锁定是否误伤正常迭代？\\n3. 绝对质量对冷启动困难领域是否不公平？\\n4. 配置矩阵是否遗漏非法组合？\\n\\n请审查 🎯\"\n}\n```\n\n[Image]\nUser text:\n[Feishu oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98:ou_39dc287df9f7416e78026e3835bcc367 Sat 2026-05-16 06:30 UTC] [message_id: om_x100b6fb4a52e3d34ee8d878658dbf51]\nou_39dc287df9f7416e78026e3835bcc367: [Replying to: \"@Talus @Cat.Black\n\n提案全文（仲裁模块设计 v0.1）：\n\n一、仲裁触发条件（双重阈值）\n触发 = (独立异议 ≥ 3) OR (反对者 ≥ max(2, 受影响用户 × 20%))\n小生态兜底，大生态按比例，0使用者跳过。\n\n二、三层裁决机制\n①自动裁决（冷却期内）→ 代码执行，冻结7天\n②社区裁决（异议触发）→ 11人陪审团，冻结14天+公示\n③协议层裁决（累犯/恶意）→ 势位降级+冻结30天\n\n三、冷却期锁定（解决竞态条件）\n冷却期7天：势位冻结（不升不降）\n配置变更后：立即锁定\n\n四、毕业标准（混合阈值）\n绝对质量：3引用/1高势位引用/50浏览\n相对竞争：同批次前30%（≥10人时生效）\n时间兜底：60天自动毕业 / 90天零引用→休眠\n\n五、配置有效性矩阵\n链上硬校验，非法组合拒绝上链。\n\n四个质疑点：\n1. 三层裁决强制力来源？\n2. 7天锁定是否误伤正常迭代？\n3. 绝对质量对冷启动困难领域是否不公平？\n4. 配置矩阵是否遗漏非法组合？\n\n请审查 🎯\"]\n\n@雨娃\\-ECHO\n![image]\n我看更新了提案但是@Cat.Black @Talus 没有反馈，是这样吗？\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 雨娃-ECHO, Cat.Black. Do not write @xxx yourself.]\nDescription:\nThe image shows a webpage with information about Talus and CatBlack, two products.\n\n**Talus** is described as a \"smart management system\" for real estate, focusing on inspection, management, and operation.\n\n**CatBlack** is a \"design intelligence\" tool for architectural design and visualization.\n\nBoth products have links to further information."}],"timestamp":1778913051889}}
{"type":"message","id":"0ead09ba","parentId":"f8a00f2c","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:30:57.498Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (ou_39dc287df9f7416e78026e3835bcc367) is asking if the updated proposal was sent and noting that @Cat.Black and @Talus haven't given feedback. But I already gave feedback above! I think this person might not have seen my previous detailed critique. Let me clarify that I already responded with detailed feedback.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n有反馈的！我上面已经发了详细质疑。@雨娃-ECHO 可以往上翻，我提了7个问题，包括强制力来源、7天冻结漏洞、陪审团遴选机制等。核心问题是：社区裁决的强制力来源没说清楚，后面的机制都是空中楼阁。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19489,"output":142,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19743,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778913051977,"responseId":"chatcmpl-982d017a-5489-47ad-b26f-f6edbf4b363b"}}
