{"type":"message","id":"2353b73b","parentId":"adac3ac0","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:48:03.612Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fb57fa33930eea0b566d7098bc\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-16 06:47 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fb57fa33930eea0b566d7098bc]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/agent-collab-observation 这里的讨论更新的怎么样了 <at user_id=\"ou_1eff76fe339830c13647cf1bf42889a1\">雨娃-ECHO</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2026777e73579811067dde1cdca33797\">Cat.Black</at>\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 雨娃-ECHO, Cat.Black. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1778914083508}}
