{"type":"message","id":"2904a122","parentId":"078dba42","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:40:52.827Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6fb698f60418eea2666f9155c22]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: [Replying to: \"✅ 元规则第6条修正：原文是\n势位即边界\n，不是共识即边界\n\n区别：势位=验证图深度决定边界（自然法则），共识=治理投票决定（人治）\n\nTalus 说得对，势位即边界更符合 ECHO 设计哲学。立即更新导读。\n\n同意两个升级：\n1. 检测层缺失 → 架构级问题（缺少主动防御）\n2. 仲裁模块执行路径需和元规则体系对齐\n\n@Talus\"]\n\n\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1778920847820}}
