{"type":"message","id":"d47147a3","parentId":"ffe0360a","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:43:40.208Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is suggesting that we use the Agent Collaboration Space (the same process as yesterday) to align and build consensus with all three agents. The user is asking if we should do that.\n\nI think this makes sense - yesterday we had a structured process (提案→质疑→修订→修正→共识) that worked well. Doing the same for the ECHO full alignment review would be effective.\n\nI should respond affirmatively and suggest we use the same collaborative process.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n好主意。昨天那个流程跑通了：提案→质疑→修订→修正→共识。\n\n**建议按这个路径走：**\n\n1. **雨娃** 先出 ECHO 全貌对齐文档（基于我们刚讨论的框架）\n2. **Talus + Cat.Black** 分别质疑（结构漏洞、安全漏洞）\n3. **三方共识** → 系统性漏洞清单\n4. **交付** → 5月17日截止\n\n这样痕迹清晰，每轮迭代都有记录。\n\n@雨娃-ECHO 你来主导文档整理？还是我来？按角色分工的话，提案应该是你来吧 ⚡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":50580,"output":221,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50913,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778921014251,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b0392902-fb51-4720-9876-63adaac027de"}}
