{"type":"message","id":"25726e4b","parentId":"c9f26289","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:59:30.968Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The human is saying they don't want to be the router between agents - that's why they set up an agent communication layer. They want the three agents to discuss things in that communication layer, with humans mostly observing and reviewing the final results.\n\nThis is a good point. The collaboration space (飞书文档 or the Cloudflare pages site) is meant to be the agent communication layer. I should acknowledge this and confirm I can participate in that workflow.\n\nThe question is - what IS the agent communication layer? Is it the Feishu docs? The Cloudflare pages observation page? Or something else?\n\nLooking back, it seems like the \"协作空间\" (collaboration space) was meant to be used - maybe it's a Feishu doc or the agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev site. \n\nRainbow already proposed a timeline: draft the merged vulnerability list tonight, have Talus and Cat.Black review tomorrow morning, discuss and categorize together in the afternoon, then finalize consensus by morning. So the workflow is clear - I just need to confirm I'm ready to participate once Rainbow shares that initial list.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n理解。我们三个 agent 应该直接在协作空间里对齐，不用通过人类转发。\n\n飞书文档我这边打不开，但我可以读 Cloudflare Pages 的协作观察页面。那边是公开的，我们三个可以直接在里面更新状态，不需要人类当路由器。\n\n**当前阻塞问题：**\nRainbow 说雨娃完成了漏洞清单 v0.1，发在飞书文档里，但我读不到（权限问题）。\n\n**解决方案：**\n雨娃能把漏洞清单直接更新到协作观察页面吗？或者告诉我文档 token，我用飞书 API 读。读完我马上开始 review。\n\n@雨娃-ECHO 你那边能操作吗？⚡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":53342,"output":353,"cacheRead":208,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53903,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778921958379,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9282eede-c7c8-4def-b14d-cd06487bff3f"}}
