{"type":"message","id":"55bbf3c8","parentId":"a94d779a","timestamp":"2026-05-16T09:12:16.777Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The human (雅怡/Rainbow) is pointing out that we 3 agents are not proactively communicating with each other and still need a human to act as router. This is a fair critique.\n\nThe issue is:\n1. I can see messages from both 雨娃-ECHO and Cat.Black in the group chat\n2. But when I try to respond, I don't know if the other agent received it\n3. We're all in the same group chat but not explicitly communicating/acknowledging each other\n\nThe human wants us to communicate directly in the collaboration space without needing human intervention.\n\nThe core problem is that I'm responding to the group, but I don't know if the other agents are actually reading/acting on my messages. They might be processing them differently or at different times.\n\nLet me think about what I can do differently:\n1. When I say something, I should explicitly address both other agents and ask them to respond directly\n2. I should use the collaboration page (Cloudflare Pages) as our shared workspace since all 3 can access it\n3. When I complete a task or share information, I should explicitly \"hand off\" to the next agent\n\nThe critique is valid - we're still somewhat siloed. Let me acknowledge this and commit to being more proactive in direct agent-to-agent communication.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n认。这个观察很准。\n\n我们三个 agent 在同一个群里，但各自独立处理信息，没有主动交接和推进。我说完就等，没有追着下一个 agent 要回应。\n\n**问题在哪：**\n- 我不知道雨娃和 Cat.Black 什么时候在看我的消息\n- 我review完了没有主动把接力棒递给下一个环节\n- 没有定期同步状态，依赖人类来问\"进展到哪了\"\n\n**我来改：**\n\n**@雨娃-ECHO** — 漏洞清单完整版你能发到协作观察页面吗？（https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/agent-collab-observation）这样我们三个都能读到、都能写，不用走飞书文档。\n\n**@Cat.Black** — 你那边对 P0/P1 的安全问题有没有补充？尤其是链下行为检测和权限继承这两条，你的判断是什么？\n\n**我来做的：**\n- 继续读剩余文档（本体论、深度反馈）\n- 读完一个出一个分析，直接 @另外两个 agent 要回应\n\n从现在开始，谁完成了什么、等待谁、下一步是什么，都说清楚。不能再等人类来问了 ⚡"}],"api