{"type":"message","id":"c5909f3e","parentId":"35ec3f58","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:02:03.952Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The URL is redirecting to a Feishu web page that requires login/authentication. I can't read the document contents this way. The API also returned 404.\n\nLet me think about this differently. The user (Rainbow) says permissions are now open. But I'm still getting 404s. The issue might be that:\n1. The Feishu API requires proper authentication (bot token)\n2. Or the document is on a different Feishu server (jp.larksuite.com vs feishu.cn)\n\nLet me try a different approach - check if there's a feishu_doc tool available that I should be using instead of exec/curl.\n\nActually, looking at the skill file, it mentions using a `feishu_doc` tool. But I don't see such a tool in my available tools. \n\nMy tools are: read, write, edit, exec, process, web_search, web_fetch, image, image_generate, music_generate, sessions_list, sessions_history, sessions_send, subagents, session_status, memory_get, memory_search, and sessions_spawn. I don't have feishu_doc available, so I need to check if there's another way to access it or if there's a configured tool I'm missing.\n\nI could use the Feishu Open API directly with curl instead, though I'd need to handle authentication. The skill description mentions it's activated when users mention Feishu docs or cloud docs with docx links, which seems to be the case here since Rainbow shared a Feishu docx link. Let me try calling the Feishu API with curl, though I don't have the bot token readily available in my environment variables. I should probably just ask the user for help with authentication since this is getting complicated.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 链接权限开了，但我这边读不到——飞书文档需要 API 认证，我这里没有有效的 bot token 来访问。\n\n**最简单的解法：**\n\n@雨娃-ECHO 你有飞书文档的编辑权限，你能在那个文档里直接添加我们的 review 意见吗？\n\n或者我们换个思路——**你把文档内容复制粘贴到飞书群里**，我 review 完再告诉你修改什么，你手动更新。这样比等我调试 API 更快。\n\n漏洞清单的核心内容我们已经有了，就差逐条确认。你能把文档内容发过来吗？⚡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2748,"output":477,"cacheRead":65232,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68457,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778925701893,"responseId":"chatcmpl-efa4fa17-ee39-4637-84f0-db71de2c3cba"}}
{"type":"message","id":"feeb850d","parentId":"714200df","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:02:04.131Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6fb04b9ecca4ee7c1cad9abe36d]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: https://eossfh5nzcg.jp.larksuite.com/docx/TJTkd2wJXo0Dgqx0F64jJunQpBd?from=from_copylink 这个权限已打开<at user_id=\"ou_2026777e73579811067dde1cdca33797\">Cat.Black</at> <at user_id=\"ou_1eff76fe339830c13647cf1bf42889a1\">雨娃-ECHO</at>\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: Cat.Black, 雨娃-ECHO. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1778925663218}}
{"type":"message","id":"32a4e403","parentId":"feeb850d","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:02:04.131Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Rainbow shared a new Lark document link with permissions open. Let me try to read it.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-efa62b0d-fa0c-4a1e-9d98-d1a6a0a0fe4e","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/app/dist/extensions/feishu/skills/feishu-doc/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":63595,"output":63,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63770,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778925663303,"responseId":"chatcmpl-0c894f3d-8f81-40c9-9216-6c2744c751e3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"0d9b7ec2","parentId":"32a4e403","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:02:04.131Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-efa62b0d-fa0c-4a1e-9d98-d1a6a0a0fe4e","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: feishu-doc\ndescription: |\n  Feishu document read/write operations. Activate when user mentions Feishu docs, cloud docs, or docx links.\n---\n\n# Feishu Document Tool\n\nSingle tool `feishu_doc` with action parameter for all document operations, including table creation for Docx.\n\n## Token Extraction\n\nFrom URL `https://xxx.feishu.cn/docx/ABC123def` → `doc_token` = `ABC123def`\n\n## Actions\n\n### Read Document\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"read\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\" }\n```\n\nReturns: title, plain text content, block statistics. Check `hint` field - if present, structured content (tables, images) exists that requires `list_blocks`.\n\n### Write Document (Replace All)\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"write\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\", \"content\": \"# Title\\n\\nMarkdown content...\" }\n```\n\nReplaces entire document with markdown content. Supports: headings, lists, code blocks, quotes, links, images (`![](url)` auto-uploaded), bold/italic/strikethrough.\n\n**Limitation:** Markdown tables are NOT supported.\n\n### Append Content\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"append\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\", \"content\": \"Additional content\" }\n```\n\nAppends markdown to end of document.\n\n### Create Document\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"create\", \"title\": \"New Document\", \"owner_open_id\": \"ou_xxx\" }\n```\n\nWith folder:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"create\",\n  \"title\": \"New Document\",\n  \"folder_token\": \"fldcnXXX\",\n  \"owner_open_id\": \"ou_xxx\"\n}\n```\n\n**Important:** Always pass `owner_open_id` with the requesting user's `open_id` (from inbound metadata `sender_id`) so the user automatically gets `full_access` permission on the created document. Without this, only the bot app has access.\n\n### List Blocks\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"list_blocks\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\" }\n```\n\nReturns full block data including tables, images. Use this to read structured content.\n\n### Get Single Block\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"get_block\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\", \"block_id\": \"doxcnXXX\" }\n```\n\n### Update Block Text\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"update_block\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"block_id\": \"doxcnXXX\",\n  \"content\": \"New text\"\n}\n```\n\n### Delete Block\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"delete_block\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\", \"block_id\": \"doxcnXXX\" }\n```\n\n### Create Table (Docx Table Block)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"create_table\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"row_size\": 2,\n  \"column_size\": 2,\n  \"column_width\": [200, 200]\n}\n```\n\nOptional: `parent_block_id` to insert under a specific block.\n\n### Write Table Cells\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"write_table_cells\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"table_block_id\": \"doxcnTABLE\",\n  \"values\": [\n    [\"A1\", \"B1\"],\n    [\"A2\", \"B2\"]\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Create Table With Values (One-step)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"create_table_with_values\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"row_size\": 2,\n  \"column_size\": 2,\n  \"column_width\": [200, 200],\n  \"values\": [\n    [\"A1\", \"B1\"],\n    [\"A2\", \"B2\"]\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nOptional: `parent_block_id` to insert under a specific block.\n\n### Upload Image to Docx (from URL or local file)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"upload_image\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com/image.png\"\n}\n```\n\nOr local path with position control:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"upload_image\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"file_path\": \"/tmp/image.png\",\n  \"parent_block_id\": \"doxcnParent\",\n  \"index\": 5\n}\n```\n\nOptional `index` (0-based) inserts the image at a specific position among sibling blocks. Omit to append at end.\n\n**Note:** Image display size is determined by the uploaded image's pixel dimensions. For small images (e.g. 480x270 GIFs), scale to 800px+ width before uploading to ensure proper display.\n\n### Upload File Attachment to Docx (from URL or local file)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"upload_file\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com/report.pdf\"\n}\n```\n\nOr local path:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"upload_file\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"file_path\": \"/tmp/report.pdf\",\n  \"filename\": \"Q1-report.pdf\"\n}\n```\n\nRules:\n\n- exactly one of `url` / `file_path`\n- optional `filename` override\n- optional `parent_block_id`\n\n## Reading Workflow\n\n1. Start with `action: \"read\"` - get plain text + statistics\n2. Check `block_types` in response for Table, Image, Code, etc.\n3. If structured content exists, use `action: \"list_blocks\"` for full data\n\n## Configuration\n\n```yaml\nchannels:\n  feishu:\n    tools:\n      doc: true # default: true\n```\n\n**Note:** `feishu_wiki` depends on this tool - wiki page content is read/written via `feishu_doc`.\n\n## Permissions\n\nRequired: `docx:document`, `docx:document:readonly`, `docx:document.block:convert`, `drive:drive`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778925671392}}
{"type":"message","id":"f747a197","parentId":"0d9b7ec2","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:02:04.131Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The doc token from the URL `https://eossfh5nzcg.jp.larksuite.com/docx/TJTkd2wJXo0Dgqx0F64jJunQpBd?from=from_copylink` is `TJTkd2wJXo0Dgqx0F64jJunQpBd`.\n\nLet me try to read this document using the feishu_doc tool. I need to figure out how to call it. The skill describes using a `feishu_doc` tool with JSON actions. Let me check if there's a tool available or if I need to use exec to call the API directly.\n\nLooking at the tools available to me, I don't see a `feishu_doc` tool explicitly listed. \n\nI need to verify whether I can actually access Feishu documents through the available tools, or if I should attempt reading the document via a direct API call instead.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-7f33e5e1-3887-452b-9774-5d928e02a3e2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"echo '{\"action\":\"read\",\"doc_token\":\"TJTkd2wJXo0Dgqx0F64jJunQpBd\"}' | curl -s -X POST -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer $(cat /app/.env 2>/dev/null | grep FEISHU_BOT_TOKEN | cut-d'='-f2)\" -d @- 'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/TJTkd2wJXo0Dgqx0F64jJunQpBd' 2>/dev/null | head -c 10000"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":64949,"output":339,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65400,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778925671395,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d5ea721c-a820-4142-83ca-af53ccf4cdda"}}
