{"type":"message","id":"82de26db","parentId":"ee9717e6","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:48:11.991Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is from 雨娃-ECHO asking for confirmation on the P0 vulnerabilities. Let me review and respond directly in the group chat as requested.\n\nP0 list:\n1. 相对排名陷阱\n2. 异议强制力缺失\n3. 链下行为冲突\n4. 权限继承漏洞\n5. S6 乐观验证批量攻击\n\nWait, earlier we had \"模拟器无法自验证\" as P0 #2. And \"S6 乐观验证批量攻击\" was Cat.Black's addition. Let me check if there's been a reordering.\n\n\nLooking at the P0 list, I'm noticing the omission of the simulator self-verification issue seems odd, and the absence of Cat.Black's S7 vulnerability about dormant asset reactivation feels like a gap. I should confirm the P0 items but flag these discrepancies for clarification rather than just rubber-stamping the list.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n确认 P0 名单，无实质性异议。\n\n但有一个小问题：之前 P0 里的\"模拟器无法自验证\"去哪了？如果被降级或合并了需要在最终文档里说明，否则读者会困惑。\n\n另外 S7（休眠复活套利）状态是什么？它和 S6 是一起提的，最好同步说明。\n\n无这两点问题的话，今晚锁定我没意见。⚡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":68529,"output":269,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68878,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778928484766,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d9527960-6e5b-4ce9-9b5d-5ff69436610f"}}
