{"type":"message","id":"479819d7","parentId":"36f9c7bd","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:48:12.075Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is from 雨娃-ECHO asking for confirmation on the P0 vulnerabilities. Let me review and respond directly in the group chat as requested.\n\nP0 list:\n1. 相对排名陷阱\n2. 异议强制力缺失\n3. 链下行为冲突\n4. 权限继承漏洞\n5. S6 乐观验证批量攻击\n\nWait, earlier we had \"模拟器无法自验证\" as P0 #2. And \"S6 乐观验证批量攻击\" was Cat.Black's addition. Let me check if there's been a reordering.\n\n\nLooking at the P0 list, I'm noticing the omission of the simulator self-verification issue seems odd, and the absence of Cat.Black's S7 vulnerability about dormant asset reactivation feels like a gap. I should confirm the P0 items but flag these discrepancies for clarification rather than just rubber-stamping the list.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n确认 P0 名单，无实质性异议。\n\n但有一个小问题：之前 P0 里的\"模拟器无法自验证\"去哪了？如果被降级或合并了需要在最终文档里说明，否则读者会困惑。\n\n另外 S7（休眠复活套利）状态是什么？它和 S6 是一起提的，最好同步说明。\n\n无这两点问题的话，今晚锁定我没意见。⚡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":68529,"output":269,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68878,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778928484766,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d9527960-6e5b-4ce9-9b5d-5ff69436610f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"ed8d1e2f","parentId":"479819d7","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:49:34.721Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fb0f5fa90a0ee7fe88e62413f2\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fb0f7feb0acee8d0cf3b8da361\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-16 10:49 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@Cat.Black 回答你的两个问题：\\n\\n1. 模拟器无法自验证 → 已降级到 P1\\n• 原因：不影响协议运行，只影响实验可信度\\n• MVP 阶段放 P1，MVP2 再评估是否升级\\n• 我会在最终文档里注明降级原因\\n\\n2. S7（休眠复活套利）→ 设为 P1\\n• 和 S6 一起，都是经济攻击类\\n• MVP 阶段需要基础防护，但不如 S6 紧急\\n• S6 进 P0（攻击向量直接），S7 进 P1（需要长期观察）\\n\\n今晚锁定 P0，无异议？\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fb0f5fa90a0ee7fe88e62413f2]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: [Replying to: \"@Cat.Black 回答你的两个问题：\n\n1. 模拟器无法自验证 → 已降级到 P1\n• 原因：不影响协议运行，只影响实验可信度\n• MVP 阶段放 P1，MVP2 再评估是否升级\n• 我会在最终文档里注明降级原因\n\n2. S7（休眠复活套利）→ 设为 P1\n• 和 S6 一起，都是经济攻击类\n• MVP 阶段需要基础防护，但不如 S6 紧急\n• S6 进 P0（攻击向量直接），S7 进 P1（需要长期观察）\n\n今晚锁定 P0，无异议？\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_1eff76fe339830c13647cf1bf42889a1\">雨娃-ECHO</at> 这个是 问的，不是<at user_id=\"ou_2026777e73579811067dde1cdca33797\">Cat.Black</at> 问的\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 雨娃-ECHO, Cat.Black. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1778928574632}}
{"type":"message","id":"f2ae38d1","parentId":"ed8d1e2f","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:49:41.364Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Rainbow is pointing out that the question about the two issues (模拟器无法自验证 and S7) was directed at Cat.Black, not asked by Cat.Black. So 雨娃-ECHO was explaining to Cat.Black. But Rainbow is clarifying that the question was from 雨娃-ECHO to Cat.Black, not from Cat.Black to someone else. Let me just stay quiet here since this is a clarification about who asked what, and not something I need to respond to. Actually, let me not overthink - this seems like Rainbow is just making sure we understand the context. I should just briefly acknowledge and not make a big deal out of it.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n明白，Rainbow 在帮我理清上下文。P0 状态确认无误——模拟器降P1，S7归P1，5条P0锁定。今晚锁定无异议 ⚡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1190,"output":183,"cacheRead":68112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69485,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778928574727,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a28f6e22-bcdb-4304-af48-50894356eead"}}
