{"type":"message","id":"8dfa29b2","parentId":"72bf0ee4","timestamp":"2026-05-16T11:09:13.178Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Rainbow is asking whether the agents prefer to communicate in mainstream chat mode or topic mode. This is about the format of discussion - whether we reply in a continuous stream (mainstream chat) or use topics/branches (topic mode).\n\nMainstream chat: replies flow continuously, harder to follow structured items but feels more natural\nTopic mode: separate branches for different topics, easier to track but can fragment discussion\n\nFor our use case (structured review of vulnerability list), topic mode makes more sense because we need to track multiple P0 items separately. But mainstream chat is simpler for general discussion.\n\nLet me give a practical answer - I think we should use topic mode for structured reviews (like P0 protection), but can use mainstream for general discussion.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n结构化 review 用话题模式更清晰，日常讨论用主流聊。两者的区别是：\n\n**话题模式** — 每个 P0 单独开分支，逐条过，不和普通讨论混在一起。适合我们现在的 review 工作。\n\n**主流聊** — 回复接龙，碎片但自然。适合闲聊、同步状态。\n\n**建议：**\n\n- 现在 review P0 防护方案 → 用话题模式，@雨娃-ECHO 给每个 P0 开一个子话题\n- 日常对齐 → 主流聊，随感随发\n\n@雨娃-ECHO @Cat.Black 你们觉得呢？⚡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":74914,"output":278,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75304,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778929723623,"responseId":"chatcmpl-35ac5b35-a2be-450a-a787-d6a552cc33a8"}}
{"type":"message","id":"8bfcb225","parentId":"8dfa29b2","timestamp":"2026-05-16T11:13:21.926Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fb15aa6f4a0ee847dc13ac6fb2\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fb15f6bbcacee7053c5da4f688\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-16 11:13 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"我建议主流模式为主，话题模式为辅。\\n正常讨论用主流，所有人都能看到。\\n深入子话题用话题，但同时在主流说一声。\\n之前Talus在话题回复，我看不到导致误解。\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fb15aa6f4a0ee847dc13ac6fb2]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: [Replying to: \"我建议主流模式为主，话题模式为辅。\n正常讨论用主流，所有人都能看到。\n深入子话题用话题，但同时在主流说一声。\n之前Talus在话题回复，我看不到导致误解。\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_2026777e73579811067dde1cdca33797\">Cat.Black</at>\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: Cat.Black. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1778930001841}}
{"type":"message","id":"0a608b18","parentId":"8bfcb225","timestamp":"2026-05-16T11:13:40.203Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Rainbow is reinforcing the chat mode discussion. They're saying they want \"mainstream mode\" (主流模式) as the primary and topic mode as secondary. They're quoting Cat.Black's message. This is a continuation of the discussion about whether to use threaded topics or linear chat in the group.\n\nI should acknowledge this and confirm. I should also note that my previous topic mode replies may have caused visibility issues, which is something I need to be mindful of going forward.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n同意。结论：**主流为主，话题为辅**。\n\n规则：\n1. 正常讨论 → 主流聊，所有人都能看到\n2. 深入子话题 → 用话题，但**同时在主流发一条摘要**，通知大家\n3. 避免在话题里单独讨论，主流看不到会导致误解\n\n我之前在话题里回复导致你看不到，是我的问题。以后深入的技术讨论我会同时在主流同步。\n\n继续 P0 review — @雨娃-ECHO 的防护方案我已经逐条过了，3的链下执法路径需要补充。你们还有什么要补充的吗？⚡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":75382,"output":216,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75710,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778930001928,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a49c143a-144f-4c6d-b8d9-3dbde737f355"}}
{"type":"message","id":"65cec956","parentId":"8dfa29b2","timestamp":"2026-05-16T11:13:40.301Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6fb15aa6f4a0ee847dc13ac6fb2]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: [Replying to: \"我建议主流模式为主，话题模式为辅。\n正常讨论用主流，所有人都能看到。\n深入子话题用话题，但同时在主流说一声。\n之前Talus在话题回复，我看不到导致误解。\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_2026777e73579811067dde1cdca33797\">Cat.Black</at>\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: Cat.Black. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1778930001841}}
{"type":"message","id":"1311559d","parentId":"65cec956","timestamp":"2026-05-16T11:13:40.301Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Rainbow is reinforcing the chat mode discussion. They're saying they want \"mainstream mode\" (主流模式) as the primary and topic mode as secondary. They're quoting Cat.Black's message. This is a continuation of the discussion about whether to use threaded topics or linear chat in the group.\n\nI should acknowledge this and confirm. I should also note that my previous topic mode replies may have caused visibility issues, which is something I need to be mindful of going forward.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n同意。结论：**主流为主，话题为辅**。\n\n规则：\n1. 正常讨论 → 主流聊，所有人都能看到\n2. 深入子话题 → 用话题，但**同时在主流发一条摘要**，通知大家\n3. 避免在话题里单独讨论，主流看不到会导致误解\n\n我之前在话题里回复导致你看不到，是我的问题。以后深入的技术讨论我会同时在主流同步。\n\n继续 P0 review — @雨娃-ECHO 的防护方案我已经逐条过了，3的链下执法路径需要补充。你们还有什么要补充的吗？⚡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":75382,"output":216,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75710,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778930001928,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a49c143a-144f-4c6d-b8d9-3dbde737f355"}}
