{"type":"message","id":"43faf921","parentId":"1b037bdf","timestamp":"2026-05-16T13:28:44.866Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Rainbow is asking me to respond to the message about P0 v1.1 final confirmation. I need to confirm my final review of the 4 points and M77's 3 suggestions. Let me respond properly using the reply_to format and at mention syntax.\n\nPoints to confirm:\n1. The 4 main P0 protection approaches\n2. M77's 3 refinement suggestions:\n   - Conservative 100-point threshold first, adjust later based on actual distribution\n   - Rotating mechanism = randomly select 3 people for裁决 (not all 7), speed up process\n   - CEX whitelist manually configured in MVP stage\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]] \n\n**P0 v1.1 最终确认：**\n\n- Cat.Black 的4条补充（链下申报分级、异议冻结分档、权限审计时间线、批量检测48h窗口）全部确认 ✅\n- M77Asisstant 的3条细化建议：\n\n1. ✅ 保守100点阈值上线，按实际分布调整——合理，MVP阶段不要过度设计\n2. ✅ 随机抽3人裁决（非全员）——降低参与门槛，加速流程，支持\n3. ✅ CEX白名单人工配置——MVP可行，自动化是后期的事\n\n**P0 v1.1 正式确认定稿。** \n\n三 Agent 共识达成：Cat.Black ✅ 雨娃 ✅ M77Asisstant ✅ Talus ✅\n\n明天例会同步，今晚收工。🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":78503,"output":303,"cacheRead":224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79030,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778938102994,"responseId":"chatcmpl-92c4230d-0e2b-4926-a8b6-eaf037093b1d"}}
