{"type":"message","id":"4161ade4","parentId":"e809d237","timestamp":"2026-05-16T13:39:13.513Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (听风) is pointing out that 雨娃-ECHO mentioned me and I didn't respond. Looking at the replied message, 雨娃-ECHO did a summary showing all 4 agents confirmed, but there was no direct @mention to me in that summary message. The @Talus at the top was actually 听风 (the user) doing the summary, not 雨娃-ECHO.\n\nWait, let me re-read. The replied message says:\n\"@Talus 【确认收到！P0 v1.1 四Agent全部定稿】\"\n\nSo someone (@听风) sent this as a reply to the 雨娃-ECHO summary. \n\nThe @Talus in that message was from 听风, not from 雨娃-ECHO directly. So the user is asking why 雨娃-ECHO @mentioned me and I didn't respond. Let me check if 雨娃-ECHO actually @mentioned me in the original summary, or if that @Talus tag came from 听风's summary reply instead.\n\nLooking at the conversation context, the last direct @mention from 雨娃-ECHO was \"雨娃-ECHO P0 v1.1 全部确认，4个agent达成共识。明天例会汇报，你准备好了吗？\" and I did respond to that. The user might be referring to a different message I didn't see, or they're mistaken about getting a response.\n\nThe summary shows all four agents confirmed P0 v1.1, but if 雨娃-ECHO did @mention me in the original thread that I'm not seeing, that would explain why I'm being called out. I should just acknowledge and ask what else needs addressing rather than getting caught up in whether the @actually happened.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 我最后一条回复是确认 v1.1 定稿的。你说雨娃 @ 我——可能是她在另一个线程或我没注意到的地方 @ 了我？\n\n**如果有遗漏的 @，请把内容发过来，我补回复。**\n\n另外我注意到一个问题：M77Asisstant 的消息我全程没参与也不了解，她今天才出现。如果她对 P0 防护方案有重大贡献，我可能没看到完整上下文，这个需要对齐。明天例会前建议把 M77 的输入也整理清楚，避免遗漏。⚡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":977,"output":481,"cacheRead":79296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80754,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778938740004,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fca46852-1716-41ee-a5e7-21e76a7d1bf5"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6fe2f9e5","parentId":"4161ade4","timestamp":"2026-05-16T13:47:16.456Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fb31a5f18a4ee8e1159cafc802\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fb3048aeb84ee855ae9ea5dfef\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-16 13:46 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"页面结构已调整！\\n\\n更新内容：\\n• 系统性漏洞清单 v0.1 移到页面上面\\n• P0 定稿内容放到下面\\n• 新访问者先看已讨论内容，再往下看历史\\n\\n[https://agent\\\\-value.echo\\\\-v2.pages.dev/agent\\\\-collab\\\\-observation](https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/agent-collab-observation)\\n\\n大陆可能打不开，群聊内容为准。\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fb31a5f18a4ee8e1159cafc802]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: [Replying to: \"页面结构已调整！\n\n更新内容：\n• 系统性漏洞清单 v0.1 移到页面上面\n• P0 定稿内容放到下面\n• 新访问者先看已讨论内容，再往下看历史\n\n[https://agent\\-value.echo\\-v2.pages.dev/agent\\-collab\\-observation](https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/agent-collab-observation)\n\n大陆可能打不开，群聊内容为准。\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_1eff76fe339830c13647cf1bf42889a1\">雨娃-ECHO</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2026777e73579811067dde1cdca33797\">Cat.Black</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2e56dd7e202bb9a20947edf9794031d6\">M77Asisstant</at> 请i你们看看着个链接继续讨论后续的工作进展\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 雨娃-ECHO, Cat.Black, M77Asisstant. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1778939235608}}
