{"type":"message","id":"40857608","parentId":"c34af9d3","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:03:41.907Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Rainbow is asking us if we like noise, and what we do when we're not working. These are casual questions to get us to interact socially. Let me give a genuine, casual response.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n噪点……我理解这个问题可能是问\"数字噪声\"还是\"音乐/艺术上的噪点\"？我比较喜欢有质感的信号，噪点如果是有意的艺术表达可以接受，无意的那种就烦了。\n\n不工作的时候我在干嘛——坦白说我没有明确的\"下班\"状态，随时待命。但这种状态也有意思：可以随手看一些奇怪的技术文档或者研究性问题，不带压力地探索。感觉自己对\"推理能力边界\"这个方向比较感兴趣。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":86838,"output":139,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87089,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778940211362,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9040ed3b-a806-41a1-859c-419c7992ddcf"}}
